  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "OnDegraded": "Continue",
  "Description": "The Motion Object Generation (PGM-MOG) AIM is a Sub-AIM of A-User Formation (PGM-AUF). It receives the Final Response, which holds all the outputs of Basic Knowledge, and divides its Process Actions. A Process Action that concerns the A-User as an entity, that is, whose subject is the Persona of the A-User (its position, its movement, its gestures), is split into Face Motion Objects and Body Motion Objects, which it gives to Entity Face Description and Entity Body Description. A Process Action whose subject is another Item or Process is passed unchanged to A-User Control. It also derives Motion Objects from the Action Objects of the Final Response. It is driven by the AUC-AUF Request and reports with an AUC-AUF Response.",
